Below is a well-structured user story for integrating the `SILEmailSender` application with the Dox system, adhering to proper standards (e.g., INVEST: Independent, Negotiable, Valuable, Estimable, Small, Testable). The user story includes a clear description, self-explanatory acceptance criteria, and a definition of done (DoD). The integration involves storing sent emails as PDFs in Azure Blob Storage via the Dox system using REST APIs hosted on Apigee, with the `EXP.DoxClient.Core` package, and updating the `SILDocumentsDetail` table with the returned `DocumentExchangeId`.

